## Verification

1. Restart the dev server (Tailwind/PostCSS caches the plugin output):
   ```bash
   npm run docs:dev
   ```
2. Open any page — the right nav menu must be a **horizontal** row inside the navbar (`Guide · Features · Getting started · …`), not a vertical floating box.
3. Confirm the navbar separator line under the bar renders as a single 1px line (no doubled `::before`/`::after` lines).
